<title>USA: RDM Sports says unit sees '97 rev increase.</title>
<headline>RDM Sports says unit sees '97 rev increase.</headline>
<dateline>ATLANTA 1997-04-14</dateline>
<text>
<p>The RDM Sports Group Inc said its 1997 forecast calls for at least a 30 percent revenue growth in in its DP unit for 1997 over 1996.</p>
<p>The company said 1996 earnings results reflect the sale of the assets of the company's camping, bicycle and snow products business to Brunswick Corp.  </p>
<p>The company said the DP unit is its fitness division. Its prediction for increased revenue comes from increased customers as a result of participating in trade shows.</p>
</text>
